{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"h":0.021265763137199412,"c":1,"w":0.23342185974121088,"x":0.68716782611346261,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.033308329468938136},{"w":0.54174758911132814,"t":"Ideas are organised and cohesion has good progression.","h":0.017527892804962808,"y":0.085669781717375493,"c":1,"x":0.12815533165110177},{"t":"Vocabulary is skilfully used, with some high-level terms [phenomenon | age-related","h":0.022691354721877444,"c":1,"w":0.77701329549153642,"x":0.12996268099407379,"y":0.11998812771132927},{"y":0.13942784559788601,"w":0.77887644449869797,"h":0.022396893367589099,"c":1,"t":"illness | impacts the health system] and some sophisticated examples [get a foot in","x":0.12997444483956258},{"w":0.22912620544433593,"c":1,"t":"the door | counterparts].","h":0.01903662221082647,"x":0.13009709339433689,"y":0.16133720938973939},{"x":0.13001171937683503,"w":0.77885655721028657,"c":1,"y":0.19594218679511965,"t":"There are a range of complex grammatical structures, including several conditional","h":0.021252586388513572},{"w":0.75550053914388005,"h":0.021436269409560005,"c":1,"y":0.21293084654058358,"x":0.13001930212043106,"t":"structures [if]. The conditionals are used to emphasise the challenges presented"},{"h":0.015672504270559551,"w":0.21776359558105471,"t":"and are without errors.","c":1,"y":0.2358631204669025,"x":0.12996844174842512},{"t":"This is a high-level, fully developed response with ideas that are well supported,","c":1,"w":0.75355626424153654,"x":0.13000129044660752,"y":0.269803625692141,"h":0.021743527231186777},{"y":0.29065420555527377,"h":0.017485328626781205,"c":1,"x":0.13009709648066148,"w":0.23300969441731773,"t":"extended and engaging."},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"137","x":0.88543689385195534,"y":0.95058139558677357,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1}]}